    callr,
    commonmark,
    ellmer (>= 0.5.0),
    htmltools,
    httpuv,
    jsonlite,
    keyring (>= 1.3.0),
    knitr,
    later,
    remotes,
    rlang,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny (>= 1.14.0)
Suggests:
    httr2,
    pdftools
URL: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant
BugReports: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant/issues
Config/RAssistant/Changes: Link the latest Console error to its recorded Source file and line, including Rmd/Quarto chunk names. Click the location in chat to open the failing code without running or editing it.
    When R provides no file reference, show a uniquely matching Source expression with an explicit Matching Source label. Ambiguous, changed or unavailable locations do not get a guessed line link.
    Send the local location evidence to the selected model for focused corrections. Keep navigation tied to the captured task and Source snapshot; never reuse an older error after a newer successful command.
